# Deploy to live site

When the user asks for app fixes or UI changes for SwapHub:

1. Implement the fix in the repo.
2. Commit the relevant changes (unless they only asked for a local experiment).
3. Push to `origin` (`alpengerz/swaphub-web`).
4. Also deploy production with Vercel CLI so https://swaphub-web.vercel.app updates immediately:
   `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes`
   (Vercel project is linked under account `pengmain2023-7671`; GitHub auto-deploy may not track the alpengerz remote.)
5. Tell the user the live URL after deploy.

Do not wait for a separate "please push" request for routine product fixes.
